# Pulsys Docker build context — deny-by-default allowlist.
#
# Only paths required by:
#   docker/Dockerfile          (compose: init / pulsys / console)
#   deploy/docker/Dockerfile   (from-source OSS image)
#   Dockerfile.security-tests  (Linux security matrix)
# enter the build context. Compose bind-mounts (e.g. Keycloak realm JSON)
# read from the host filesystem and do NOT need to be in the image context.
#
# GoReleaser's runtime image uses deploy/docker/Dockerfile.goreleaser with a
# tiny context of prebuilt binaries — it does not send the repo source tree.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Deny everything recursively, then re-include only what builds need.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
**

# --- Go module + compilable source (go:embed stays under internal/) ---
!go.mod
!go.sum
!cmd/
!cmd/**
!internal/
!internal/**

# --- Admin UI: lockfiles + Next config + src only (no .env, tests, deps) ---
!admin-ui/
admin-ui/**
!admin-ui/package.json
!admin-ui/package-lock.json
!admin-ui/next.config.ts
!admin-ui/tsconfig.json
!admin-ui/next-env.d.ts
!admin-ui/src/
!admin-ui/src/**

# --- Runtime scripts + nginx for compose/console images ---
# Intentionally omit docker/keycloak/ (dev realm with default password);
# compose mounts it from the host: ./docker/keycloak/pulsys-realm.json
!docker/
docker/**
!docker/nginx/
!docker/nginx/**
!docker/scripts/
!docker/scripts/**

# --- Security-tests entrypoint only (rest of scripts/ stays out) ---
!scripts/
scripts/**
!scripts/security-tests-entrypoint.sh

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Belt-and-suspenders: never allow these even if a future ! rule widens scope.
# Last matching pattern wins — keep these AFTER the allowlist.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/*.jks
**/id_rsa*
**/id_ed25519*
**/id_ecdsa*
**/*credential*
**/*credentials*
**/.aws/
**/.config/gcloud/
**/kubeconfig*
**/*.kubeconfig
**/*.tfstate
**/*.tfstate.*
**/.terraform/
**/cdk.context.json
**/cdk.out/
**/*secret*.json
**/node_modules/
**/.next/
# Root-only scratch dirs (do NOT use **/cache — that would drop internal/cache).
/tmp
/tmp/**
/cache
/cache/**
/bin
/bin/**
admin-ui/out
admin-ui/out/**
.git
.github
.cursor
**/.DS_Store
